"Runs the client exactly as it shipped. Fine on servers without anti-cheat — but if the server runs Warden, the game can crash once it starts checking." = "完全按原样运行客户端。在没有反作弊的服务器上没有问题；但如果服务器使用 Warden，检查开始时游戏可能会崩溃。";
"Applies at the next game start." = "在下次启动游戏时生效。";
"Checking the client…" = "正在检查客户端…";
