"The client will be copied in and started exactly as it shipped. Copying takes a while and uses as much disk space as the client folder." = "客户端会被原样复制并启动。复制需要一些时间，占用的磁盘空间与客户端文件夹相同。";
"Install Anyway" = "仍然安装";
