"This client is 64-bit — everything the launcher adds is 32-bit only, so none of it can load into the game." = "此客户端为 64 位——启动器添加的一切都只有 32 位版本，无法加载进游戏。";
"This client has no Divx decoder for the mod loader to hook, so no extra DLL can be added to it." = "此客户端没有可供模组加载器挂钩的 Divx 解码器，因此无法为它添加任何 DLL。";
"libSiliconPatch exists only for 3.3.5a (12340) and 1.12 clients; the other levels apply as usual." = "libSiliconPatch 仅存在于 3.3.5a（12340）和 1.12 客户端；其他级别照常适用。";
